      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آئْتَرِشْ</span></b>  [written with the disjunctive alif <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِيتَرِشْ</span>] <i>Take thou from him the
fine,</i> or <i>mulct, for thy</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُمَاشَة</span>, q. v. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آئْتَرَشَ لِلْخُمَاشَةِ</span> [<i>He surrendered himself to pay
